    "level": "junior",
    "tag": "backend",
    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Tagless Switch</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-junior\">junior</span><span class=\"p-time\">8 min</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>Sign classification reads cleaner as a <code>switch</code> with no tag: each case is a</p>\n<p>boolean condition, evaluated top to bottom \u2014 the same shape as an</p>\n<p>if/else-if chain, but flatter.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>Classify</code> in tagless.go with a tagless <code>switch</code>:</p>\n<p><code>n &lt; 0</code> \u2192 \"negative\", <code>n == 0</code> \u2192 \"zero\", otherwise \"positive\".</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nClassify(-5) // =&gt; \"negative\"\nClassify(0)  // =&gt; \"zero\"\nClassify(7)  // =&gt; \"positive\"\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Tagless switch</span><span class=\"tchip\">Top-to-bottom</span><span class=\"tchip\">default as else</span></div></details>",
    "education": "",
    "starter": "// Package tagless \u2014 Gopher Workplace challenge.\npackage tagless\n\n// Classify returns the sign of n using a tagless switch (a switch with no\n// expression, whose cases are boolean conditions \u2014 a clean if/else-if chain).\n//\n//\tn < 0  => \"negative\"\n//\tn == 0 => \"zero\"\n//\tn > 0  => \"positive\"\n//\n// Examples:\n//\n//\tClassify(-5) => \"negative\"\n//\tClassify(0)  => \"zero\"\n//\tClassify(7)  => \"positive\"\nfunc Classify(n int) string {\n\t// TODO(candidate): implement this from scratch so all tests pass.\n\tpanic(\"not implemented\")\n}\n",
    "debug": "// Package tagless \u2014 Gopher Workplace challenge.\n//\n// DEBUG MODE: this version compiles and looks right, but ships one planted bug.\n// Find it between the CHANGE CODE markers and fix it so all tests pass.\npackage tagless\n\nfunc Classify(n int) string {\n\tswitch {\n\t// CHANGE CODE BELOW THIS LINE\n\n\tcase n <= 0:\n\t\treturn \"negative\"\n\n\t// CHANGE CODE ABOVE THIS LINE\n\tcase n == 0:\n\t\treturn \"zero\"\n\tdefault:\n\t\treturn \"positive\"\n\t}\n}\n",
